ProcessReleaseRequest.description:
Optional configuration for the release operation.

**Notification behavior:**
- Empty body → no notifications sent (legacy behavior)
- `language` set (deprecated) → all participants notified in that language
- `notification` object present → explicit control via `locale` and `suppress`

**Migration from `language` to `notification`:**
```json
// Old (deprecated):
{ "language": "de-CH" }

// New (recommended):
{ "notification": { "locale": "de-CH" } }

// Suppress specific types:
{ "notification": { "locale": "de-CH", "suppress": ["INVITE"] } }

// Suppress all notifications:
{ "notification": { "locale": "de-CH", "suppress": ["ALL"] } }
```

**Supported locales:** `en-GB`, `de-CH`, `fr-CH`, `it-CH` (BCP-47)
